---
layout: base.njk
title: AWS Topic Guides for Software Engineers | AWS for Engineers
description: Browse AWS guides by topic, from Lambda and S3 to networking, monitoring, databases, security, migration, and architecture.
permalink: /topics/
---
<section class="topic-index wrap">
  <header class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Learn and troubleshoot AWS</p>
    <h1>AWS topic guides</h1>
    <p>Find a starting point or a focused guide for the task you are working on. Each topic groups the existing articles into a reading path, with introductions, practical workflows, and troubleshooting references.</p>
    <p>Prefer to browse by publication date? <a href="/blog/">View all {{ collections.posts | length }} articles</a>.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="topic-grid">
    {% for topic in topics %}
    <a class="topic-card" href="/topics/{{ topic.slug }}/">
      <h2>{{ topic.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ topic.description }}</p>
      <span>{{ topic | topicArticleCount }} guides →</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
